約情況。","sentiment":1,"tags":{"topics":["匯率","航運/傳產"],"bull":["大漲","反彈"],"bear":[],"score":3,"highlights":[],"keywords":["運價","海運","航運指數","SCFI","貨櫃","陽明","長榮","萬海"]},"time":"11/27 18:56"},{"id":"ea0b31e21b3abc40","source":"永豐金證券","category":"台股","title":"三大法人買賣超 – 外資買超(2603)長榮、(2882)國泰金，投信買超(8299)群聯、(2412)中華電，法人合計賣超213.04億元","link":"https://news.google.?oc=5","published":1795769544,"summary":"三大法人買賣超 – 外資買超(2603)長榮、(2882)國泰金，投信買超(8299)群聯、(2412)中華電，法人合計賣超213.04億元 永豐金證券","sentiment":1,"tags":{"topics":["法人動向","金融"],"bull":["買超","法人買"],"bear":["賣超"],"score":2,"highlights":[],"keywords":[]},"time":"11/27 16:52"},{"id":"e86c7937d2a8219e","source":"CMoney","category":"台股","title":"2603 長榮 - 《長榮》盤中發出起漲訊號、盤後又入選「主動式ETF加碼」 - 股市爆料同學會","link":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTE8ybFpzSjI3TXFNUWZUMlRkdm9YTFZ6VWlBM0Vlc19BU29Wb0tMU2FncVZQLVdDSm91T1RWLTFPNzM4ZHhXMlViMjI2NjF3c0JUT19jcWJ0LUg?oc=5","published":1795736748,"summary":"2603 長榮 - 《長榮》盤中發出起漲訊號、盤後又入選「主動式ETF加碼」 - 股市爆料同學會 CMoney","sentiment":1,"tags":{"topics":["盤後"],"bull":["加碼"],"bear":[],"score":2,"highlights":[],"keywords":[]},"time":"11/27 07:45"},{"id":"b4eb99f74d311661","source":"富聯網","category":"台股","title":"《外資》買超股：華通、長榮、台新新光金","link":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxQTXFEb0lYUWFackVfb3VPVjVfdkVTZFNEXzJYWjdkQ1M0dURUYmxQUUVtOWdyNDlfaUE2ZDdUTW5OWGVua3NyTThFajZqcjdrbF96WktyczVuNnhWWTB0T2RtN3MxcDlnVzFQbkNDOHd3MUFJNFpOY3hXMmNMQmRnQzdXR201Y2ps?oc=5","published":1795736220,"summary":"《外資》買超股：華通、長榮、台新新光金 富聯網","sentiment":1,"tags":{"topics":["法人動向"],"bull":["買超"],"bear":[],"score":2,"highlights":[],"keywords":[]},"time":"11/27 07:37"},{"id":"ddfc00833b53a32b","source":"富聯網","category":"台股","title":"《外資買超31-6》燿華(2690)、半導體(2611)、中石化(2603)","link":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxPN0J5TElFRjkzZ2hLUFdNZmsxVFRRRjdaaF9LOTJxM0ZpdkFmVlBxOS1EX1NrTUZ2YmJENTNtN0JEMWJPTnZub2NHbjlucGRpS3ZsQXJJWFlZd0NwRkRmQmpkNktxOEY3S1k2MG5ISkR4dDFaNjZvYkV5SEpiVUhKeXJ0MEUyak91?oc=5","published":1795736